                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7 or 8 (64bit) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 3GHz Intel i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 6 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> DirectX 10.x or OpenGL 3.3 with video card with 1GB ram and support for v4 shaders<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 10<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 7 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX 9.0c compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> May not work properly with Windows 7 and 8 (32bit) version</li></ul>"
